<title>USA: General Employment sets special payout.</title>
<headline>General Employment sets special payout.</headline>
<dateline>OAKBROOK TERRACE, Ill. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Employment Enterprises Inc said Tuesday its board of directors approved a special year-end cash dividend of $0.06 a share.</p>
<p>The special dividend will be paid on January 17, 1997, to shareholders of record December 16.</p>
<p>General Employment and its wholly owned subsidiary, Triad Personnel Services Inc, provide permanent and contract staffing services specializing in information technology.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
